        "use_own_file": false,
        "modifier": "haircare",
        "modifier_2": "none",
        "background_color": "none",
        "section_id": "",
        "heading": "<h2>Go beyond surface-level haircare</h2>",
        "text": "<p>Traditional serums sit on the scalp or rinse away. Once every 2 weeks, the <strong>Micro-Infusion Pro Hair</strong> System uses 0.5mm 24k gold-plated microneedles to create tiny micro-channels that help deliver serum actives directly where they’re needed most. On the days in between, the <strong>Hair Renewal Serum</strong> keeps your scalp conditioned.</p><p>This patent-pending system’s virtually painless microneedles go beyond the skin’s surface, boosting serum absorption and delivering powerful actives exactly where they’re needed.</p><p><strong>How Qure refreshes your skin in 3 easy steps:</strong></p><p>[step]</p><ul><li><strong>Stamp<br/></strong>Virtually painless micro-stamping with 0.5mm needles on a sterile, single-use tip.</li><li><strong>Infuse<br/></strong>Designed to help deliver serum actives directly to the scalp surface.</li><li><strong>Renews<br/></strong>Supports the look of fuller, denser-looking hair over time.</li></ul>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_url": "",
        "wistia_url": "jhwgazmjv8",
        "accordion_text": ""
      }
    },
